WARNING: --apply-scope cluster grants write on every kind the env renders, in every namespace. Where the render
carries RBAC, escalate and bind are held only on the exact Role/ClusterRole names it declares, so the identity cannot mint a
role the render does not name, but it can still rewrite those named roles and bind them. Prefer --apply-scope namespace:<ns>
where the env fits.

